Package: goblin-gate
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Network Goblin Labs <goblin@localhost>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: systemd, systemd-sysv, systemd-timesyncd, dbus, udev, iproute2, nftables, kea-dhcp4-server, unbound, dns-root-data, ulogd2, ulogd2-json, wireguard-tools, ca-certificates, iputils-ping, tcpdump
Recommends: suricata (>= 7), suricata-update, tailscale, miniupnpd-nftables
Conflicts: ifupdown2, network-manager, systemd-resolved
Description: Goblin Gate firewall
 A home and small-office firewall and router: nftables policies, DHCP
 (Kea), DNS with filtering (Unbound), threat feeds, Suricata IPS, a web
 filter, application control, WireGuard and Tailscale, managed through
 a web UI, a FortiOS-style CLI and a console menu.
